    Portuguese: 'Nenhum jogador corresponde aos filtros.

      Tente outro nome
      ou limpe a busca.'
    English: 'No players match these filters.

      Try another name or clear the
      search.'
  - Key: career.previous
    Portuguese: Anterior
    English: Previous
  - Key: career.next
    Portuguese: "Pr\xF3xima"
    English: Next
  - Key: career.attributes
    Portuguese: "Atributos \xB7 escala de 0 a 100"
    English: "Attributes \xB7 scale from 0 to 100"
  - Key: career.squadDetailsHint
    Portuguese: "As posi\xE7\xF5es s\xE3o as naturais do jogador. O XI \xE9 escolhido
      automaticamente a partir do elenco e da forma\xE7\xE3o salva em T\xE1tica."
    English: "These are the player\u2019s natural positions. The starting XI is selected
      automatically from your squad and the saved tactical formation."
  - Key: career.offerAmount
    Portuguese: "Valor total da proposta \xB7 n\xFAmeros inteiros"
    English: "Total offer amount \xB7 whole numbers"
  - Key: career.amountPlaceholder
    Portuguese: 'Ex.: 250000'
    English: e.g. 250000
  - Key: career.makeOffer
    Portuguese: Fazer proposta
    English: Make an offer
  - Key: career.submitOffer
    Portuguese: Enviar proposta
    English: Submit offer
  - Key: career.cancelOffer
    Portuguese: Cancelar
    English: Cancel offer
  - Key: career.offerConfirmTitle
    Portuguese: Confirmar proposta
    English: Confirm offer
  - Key: career.offerConfirmBody
    Portuguese: "{0} \xB7 {1}\nCusto total: {2}\n\nEsse valor ficar\xE1 reservado
      at\xE9 a resposta no pr\xF3ximo dia. O custo \xE9 apenas a taxa de transfer\xEAncia;
      sal\xE1rios e novos contratos ainda n\xE3o s\xE3o negociados."
    English: "{0} \xB7 {1}\nTotal cost: {2}\n\nThis amount will be reserved until
      tomorrow\u2019s decision. The cost covers only the transfer fee; wages and
      new contracts are not negotiated yet."
  - Key: career.transferBudget
    Portuguese: "Dispon\xEDvel para propostas: {0}\nReservado em propostas pendentes:
      {1}"
    English: 'Available for offers: {0}

      Reserved for pending offers: {1}'
  - Key: career.offerCount
    Portuguese: "{0} propostas \xB7 decis\xF5es aparecem ap\xF3s avan\xE7ar o dia
      na carreira"
    English: "{0} offers \xB7 advance the career day to receive decisions"
  - Key: career.noOffers
    Portuguese: "Voc\xEA ainda n\xE3o fez propostas.\nUse Buscar jogadores para escolher
      um refor\xE7o."
    English: 'You have not made any offers yet.

      Use Find players to choose
      a new signing.'
  - Key: career.offerDates
    Portuguese: "Enviada em {0} \xB7 Resposta: {1}"
    English: "Submitted {0} \xB7 Decision: {1}"
  - Key: career.tomorrow
    Portuguese: "pr\xF3ximo dia"
    English: next day
  - Key: career.alreadyOwned
    Portuguese: "Esse jogador j\xE1 pertence ao seu clube."
    English: This player already belongs to your club.
  - Key: career.offerPending
    Portuguese: "J\xE1 existe uma proposta pendente. Veja Minhas propostas para consultar
      ou cancelar."
    English: An offer is already pending. Open My offers to view or cancel it.
  - Key: career.valuation
    Portuguese: "Estimativa: {0} \xB7 Dispon\xEDvel: {1}\nValor de simula\xE7\xE3o;
      a aceita\xE7\xE3o depende tamb\xE9m do elenco do vendedor."
    English: "Estimate: {0} \xB7 Available: {1}\nSimulated value; acceptance also
      depends on the selling club\u2019s squad."
  - Key: career.offerSubmitted
    Portuguese: Proposta enviada. Avance o dia para receber a resposta.
    English: Offer submitted. Advance the day to receive a decision.
  - Key: career.offerCancelled
    Portuguese: Proposta cancelada; o valor reservado foi liberado.
    English: Offer cancelled; the reserved amount has been released.
  - Key: career.offerCompleted
    Portuguese: "Contrata\xE7\xE3o conclu\xEDda. O jogador j\xE1 est\xE1 no seu elenco."
    English: Transfer completed. The player is now in your squad.
  - Key: career.offerInvalid
    Portuguese: "Informe um valor inteiro entre 0 e 2.147.483.647. Jogadores com
      clube exigem taxa positiva; sem clube, a taxa \xE9 zero."
    English: Enter a whole number from 0 to 2,147,483,647. Registered players require
      a positive fee; free agents require zero.
  - Key: career.offerInsufficientFunds
    Portuguese: "Saldo dispon\xEDvel insuficiente. Reduza o valor ou cancele outra
      proposta pendente."
    English: Insufficient available funds. Reduce the amount or cancel another pending
      offer.
  - Key: career.offerUnavailable
    Portuguese: "N\xE3o foi poss\xEDvel concluir a proposta. Verifique o jogador,
      as propostas pendentes e a data da carreira."
    English: The offer could not be completed. Check the player, pending offers and
      career date.
  - Key: career.managementEnded
    Portuguese: "Calend\xE1rio encerrado. Consultas continuam dispon\xEDveis."
    English: Calendar ended. You can still view this information.
  - Key: career.tacticsScope
    Portuguese: "Defina a forma\xE7\xE3o e a postura padr\xE3o para as pr\xF3ximas
      partidas da carreira."
    English: Set the default formation and mentality for upcoming career matches.
  - Key: career.formation
    Portuguese: "Forma\xE7\xE3o"
    English: Formation
  - Key: career.mentality
    Portuguese: Postura
    English: Mentality
  - Key: career.savedTactics
    Portuguese: "Em uso: {0} \xB7 {1}"
    English: "In use: {0} \xB7 {1}"
  - Key: career.applyTactics
    Portuguese: "Salvar padr\xE3o t\xE1tico"
    English: Save tactical setup
  - Key: career.tacticsSaved
    Portuguese: "Padr\xE3o t\xE1tico salvo para as pr\xF3ximas partidas."
    English: Tactical setup saved for upcoming matches.
  - Key: career.tacticsEffect
    Portuguese: "A forma\xE7\xE3o define as posi\xE7\xF5es do XI autom\xE1tico. A
      postura orienta o comportamento da equipe na partida 3D."
    English: "Formation defines the automatic XI\u2019s positions. Mentality guides
      the team\u2019s behaviour in the 3D match."
  - Key: career.automaticXI
    Portuguese: "XI autom\xE1tico \xB7 padr\xE3o salvo"
    English: "Automatic XI \xB7 saved setup"
  - Key: career.lineupHint
    Portuguese: "Posi\xE7\xF5es exibidas s\xE3o naturais. Escala\xE7\xE3o manual
      ser\xE1 uma etapa futura."
    English: Positions shown are natural positions. Manual team selection is a future
      step.
  - Key: career.tacticsDraft
    Portuguese: "Altera\xE7\xF5es pendentes. Salve para aplic\xE1-las."
    English: Unsaved changes. Save to apply them.
  - Key: career.tacticsCurrent
    Portuguese: "O padr\xE3o salvo est\xE1 aplicado."
    English: Your saved setup is active.
