    Portuguese: Aceita
    English: Accepted
  - Key: offerStatus.Rejected
    Portuguese: Recusada
    English: Rejected
  - Key: offerStatus.Cancelled
    Portuguese: Cancelada
    English: Cancelled
  - Key: offerReason.None
    Portuguese: "Aguardando resposta do pr\xF3ximo dia."
    English: "Awaiting the next day\u2019s decision."
  - Key: offerReason.BelowValuation
    Portuguese: "Valor abaixo da avalia\xE7\xE3o do jogador."
    English: "The amount is below the player\u2019s valuation."
  - Key: offerReason.SellerSquadTooSmall
    Portuguese: O clube vendedor ficaria sem jogadores suficientes.
    English: The selling club would not have enough players.
  - Key: offerReason.SellerNeedsGoalkeeper
    Portuguese: O clube vendedor precisa manter um goleiro.
    English: The selling club needs to retain a goalkeeper.
  - Key: offerReason.InsufficientFunds
    Portuguese: "Saldo insuficiente no momento da decis\xE3o."
    English: Insufficient funds when the decision was made.
  - Key: offerReason.PlayerUnavailable
    Portuguese: "O jogador deixou de estar dispon\xEDvel."
    English: The player is no longer available.
  - Key: offerReason.Cancelled
    Portuguese: Cancelada pelo treinador; valor reservado liberado.
    English: Cancelled by the manager; reserved funds released.
  - Key: news.transfer-accepted
    Portuguese: "{0} acertou a chegada de {4} por {3}. O refor\xE7o j\xE1 integra
      o elenco nesta carreira."
    English: '{0} have signed {4} for {3}. The player has joined the squad in this
      career.'
  - Key: news.transfer-rejected
