  - Key: career.lineupPreview
    Portuguese: "Pr\xE9via da forma\xE7\xE3o"
    English: Formation preview
  - Key: career.previewPlayers
    Portuguese: "XI da pr\xE9via"
    English: Preview XI
  - Key: career.previewPositions
    Portuguese: "Posi\xE7\xE3o na forma\xE7\xE3o selecionada"
    English: Slot in the selected formation
  - Key: career.previewHelp
    Portuguese: "A pr\xE9via acompanha o rascunho. Salve para aplicar. O XI \xE9
      autom\xE1tico; os jogadores ainda n\xE3o podem ser arrastados ou escolhidos
      manualmente."
    English: The preview follows your draft. Save to apply. The XI is automatic;
      dragging and manual player selection are not available yet.
  - Key: career.previewUnavailable
    Portuguese: "N\xE3o foi poss\xEDvel montar os onze jogadores para esta forma\xE7\xE3o.
      Verifique o elenco."
    English: Eleven players could not be selected for this formation. Check your
