    Portuguese: "T\xE9cnica"
    English: Technical
  - Key: career.attributesPhysical
    Portuguese: "F\xEDsico"
    English: Physical
  - Key: career.attributesGame
    Portuguese: Jogo
    English: Game
  - Key: career.tacticsEffectCompact
    Portuguese: "A forma\xE7\xE3o define as posi\xE7\xF5es. A postura orienta a equipe
      em campo."
    English: Formation sets the positions. Mentality guides the team on the pitch.
  - Key: career.tacticsInteractiveHelp
    Portuguese: "Arraste para ajustar posi\xE7\xF5es e escolha a fun\xE7\xE3o. Salve
      para aplicar. O XI \xE9 autom\xE1tico; trocar a forma\xE7\xE3o restaura posi\xE7\xF5es
      e fun\xE7\xF5es."
    English: Drag to adjust positions and choose roles. Save to apply. The XI is
      automatic; changing formation resets positions and roles.
  - Key: career.selectedTacticSlot
    Portuguese: "Fun\xE7\xE3o \xB7 {0} {1}"
    English: "Role \xB7 {0} {1}"
  - Key: career.resetTacticSlot
    Portuguese: Restaurar vaga
    English: Reset slot
  - Key: career.resetTacticPlan
    Portuguese: Restaurar tudo
    English: Reset all
  - Key: career.tacticsKeyboard
    Portuguese: "Setas: mover \xB7 Esc: controles"
    English: "Arrows: move \xB7 Esc: controls"
  - Key: career.role.Standard
    Portuguese: "Padr\xE3o da posi\xE7\xE3o"
    English: Position default
  - Key: career.roleEffect.Standard
    Portuguese: "Segue o comportamento padr\xE3o da posi\xE7\xE3o."
    English: Uses the position's default behaviour.
  - Key: career.role.AdvancingCentreBack
    Portuguese: Zagueiro de apoio
    English: Advancing centre-back
  - Key: career.roleEffect.AdvancingCentreBack
    Portuguese: "Avan\xE7a para apoiar quando a equipe tem a bola."
    English: Moves forward to support the team in possession.
  - Key: career.role.CrossingFullBack
    Portuguese: Lateral cruzador
    English: Crossing full-back
  - Key: career.roleEffect.CrossingFullBack
    Portuguese: "Mant\xE9m a largura e favorece cruzamentos."
    English: Stays wide and favours crosses.
  - Key: career.role.InvertedFullBack
    Portuguese: Lateral invertido
    English: Inverted full-back
  - Key: career.roleEffect.InvertedFullBack
    Portuguese: Aproxima-se do centro para apoiar a jogada.
    English: Moves inside to support the play.
  - Key: career.role.BallWinningMidfielder
    Portuguese: Volante marcador
    English: Ball-winning midfielder
  - Key: career.roleEffect.BallWinningMidfielder
    Portuguese: "Fecha a marca\xE7\xE3o e avan\xE7a menos."
    English: Marks tighter and holds position.
  - Key: career.role.DeepLyingPlaymaker
    Portuguese: Armador recuado
    English: Deep-lying playmaker
  - Key: career.roleEffect.DeepLyingPlaymaker
    Portuguese: "Apoia a sa\xEDda de bola e prioriza passes."
    English: Supports the build-up and prioritizes passing.
  - Key: career.role.CreativePlaymaker
    Portuguese: Meia criativo
    English: Creative playmaker
  - Key: career.roleEffect.CreativePlaymaker
    Portuguese: Busca passes mais progressivos.
    English: Looks for more progressive passes.
  - Key: career.role.TargetForward
    Portuguese: "Atacante piv\xF4"
    English: Target forward
  - Key: career.roleEffect.TargetForward
    Portuguese: "Oferece apoio central e devolu\xE7\xF5es curtas."
    English: Offers central support and short layoffs.
  - Key: career.role.MobileForward
    Portuguese: "Atacante m\xF3vel"
    English: Mobile forward
  - Key: career.roleEffect.MobileForward
    Portuguese: "Avan\xE7a e aproxima-se da jogada."
    English: Moves forward and supports the play.
  - Key: career.role.WideWinger
    Portuguese: Ponta aberto
    English: Wide winger
  - Key: career.roleEffect.WideWinger
    Portuguese: "Mant\xE9m amplitude e oferece op\xE7\xE3o por fora."
    English: Stays wide to offer an outside passing option.
  - Key: career.role.InsideForward
    Portuguese: Ponta por dentro
    English: Inside forward
  - Key: career.roleEffect.InsideForward
    Portuguese: Sai da faixa lateral para apoiar por dentro.
    English: Leaves the flank to support through the middle.
